
flowchart TD
    A([Start Prediction System]) --> B[Load Tuned OvR Model]
    B --> C[Load Tuned Softmax Model]
    C --> D[Ask User for Four Measurements]
    D --> E[Validate User Input]

    E --> F{Are Inputs Valid?}
    F -->|No| G[Display Error Message]
    G --> D

    F -->|Yes| H[Create Feature DataFrame]
    H --> I[OvR Model Prediction]
    H --> J[Softmax Model Prediction]

    I --> K[Calculate Class Probabilities]
    J --> L[Calculate Class Probabilities]

    K --> M[Display OvR Results]
    L --> N[Display Softmax Results]

    M --> O([End])
    N --> O
